# GHOPHOI - FIXTURE CHAT LUONG GHEP (hai chu U moc vao nhau)
# Chu U 310x300, hai canh rong 100, long rong 110 sau 200. Xoay 180 do roi dich 105 mm
# thi canh cua cai nay chui vao long cai kia (khe 5 mm moi phia) - cap U moc nhau
# chiem 415 x 405. To rong 420 (dat duoc 410) nen hai U KHONG chong doc duoc
# (300+5+300 > 410): khong moc thi moi U mot cot rieng.
#   Moc dung 2 cap: 5 + 415 + 5 + 415 + 5 = 845 mm.  Khong moc: 4 cot = 1245 mm.
SETTINGS gap=5 margin=5 mirror=0 rotations=0,90,180,270 inhole=0 seed=1 budget=60 extra=3
SHEET name=420x2500 length=2500 width=420
PART id=U qty=4 material=1.2MM tol=0 name=CHUU_MOC
OUTER 0,0 310,0 310,300 210,300 210,100 100,100 100,300 0,300
END
EXPECT placed=4 unplaced=0 sheets=1 usedlength<=846 mingap>=5 minedge>=5
